# P57 Four-Wave Launch Failure Evidence (Commit 8ec9246b)

All 4 jobs (`canon-p57-fl-mism-p45n-8ec9246b`, `canon-p57-fl-mism-m15-m15n-8ec9246b`, `canon-p57-fl-is-p45i-8ec9246b`, `canon-p57-fl-is-m15-m15i-8ec9246b`) were provisioned and executed on 256 TPU chips, passing all preflights.

However, in `examples/frozenlake/train_frozenlake_qwen3.py:315`, `dp_workloads.validate_p57_stock_train_environment` failed because `expected` dict in `tunix/rl/dp_workloads.py:820-840` hardcodes:
- `CANON_P57_TIM_ARM: "mismatch"` (rejects `is`)
- `CANON_P57_WORKLOAD_CANDIDATE: "m15"` (rejects P45 generator where candidate is empty)
- `CANON_P57_DATA_SPLIT: "selection"` (rejects M15 main split where split is `main`)

